ivate profiles, author-only and unpublished memories, hidden MNO messages, and preserved source archives. Full private archives require confirmation.Export formatShareable adventureFull private archivePublic world onlySelected contentPreview exportDownload reviewed exportReturn to the main workspace to import an adventure as a separate session.Edit selected world · save changes as a new versionAdventure sessions keep the world version they started with. This edit only affects new adventures.World namePublic world summaryPublic setting premiseA quiet coast where old signals still matter.Edit the opening scene (optional)This version's public scene seed is used only for the first generated reply. It sets the situation and hook without choosing the hero's response.Opening situationFog rests over Old Harbor.Immediate hookA blue lantern answers from the cliffs.Leave both fields empty to remove the opening scene in the new version.Optional world coverThis image is pinned with the new version and included in world packages.Starting locationMap locationsOld Harbor\nNorth PierUse unique names; if a starting location is set, include it here. Adventures already started keep their pinned map.World-specific trackershealth=8/10One tracker per line as name=current/maximum. These rules affect new adventures from this version.Game mechanics · d20These rules are pinned to each new world version. Lorethra resolves all dice, skill bonuses, targets, and experience totals locally.Resolution modeDeterministic d20Custom diceNarrative onlyHybrid · roll or narrateDice per checkSides per dieDice resolutionAdd all diceKeep highest dieCount successesDifficulty rulesRule IDDisplay nameTargetRemove difficultyRule IDDisplay nameTargetRemove difficultyRule IDDisplay nameTargetRemove difficultyRule IDDisplay nameTargetRemove difficultyAdd difficultyEncounter typesInclude social, exploration, or other noncombat scenes when your world uses them.Type IDDisplay nameRemove typeType IDDisplay nameRemove typeType IDDisplay nameRemove typeType IDDisplay nameRemove typeAdd encounter typeSkills and proficiencyAdd skillExperienceAward modeManual awardsAutomatic per player turnAutomatic and manualStarting XPMaximum XPCurrent version: v1Save new versionThis story has a separate copy of the world. Changes here stay in this story. New stories use the original world with its latest changes.Story transcript ready. 2 loaded of 2 saved turns.Youبه چراغ آبی نزدیک می‌شوم. / I move toward the blue lantern. [audit edit]Turn optionsEditHidePlayer turn details · 2 saved versionsSaved in revision4Saved11/6/2026, 9:48:13 AMEarlier saved versionsOriginal saved turnRevision 4 · 11/6/2026, 9:48:13 AMبه چراغ آبی نزدیک می‌شوم. / I move toward the blue lantern.Version 1 · CurrentRevision 6 · 11/6/2026, 10:04:53 AMبه چراغ آبی نزدیک می‌شوم. / I move toward the blue lantern. [audit edit]Jump to latest ↓What do you do or say?Provider and model settingsOpen to choose a narrator · Model not selectedAI providerOllama · localModelChoose a modelUse a custom model IDMore story optionsStory orderContinue story ✳Adventure details & toolsرُها / Roya · Old HarborCloseHero & mechanics1Memories1NPCsMapStory historyMore toolsYour adventureرُها / Roya · The Lantern CoastCurrent locationOld HarborCharacter details0 XP · 1 suggestion to reviewHero identityNotes guide local identity and voice without overriding story controls. This adventure keeps its own copy; edits do not affect your reusable hero or other adventures. Hosted providers do not receive these notes.No identity notes saved for this adventure.Add identity notesStatsmight+1wit+2Edit stat modifiersmightwitSave statsTrackershealth8 / 10Experience0 / 1,000,000 XPXP is added when you choose a reward in this world.XP amount to addAdd XPRoll a checkThis world version uses manual checks. Choose what to check and roll using its saved rules.EncounterCombatSocialExplorationOtherSkillNo skillAttributemightwitDifficultyEasy · 8Standard · 12Hard · 16Very hard · 20Roll using pinned rulesState changes for review · 1 pendingChange typeAdjust a trackerSuggest a locationTrackerhealthChangeA suggestion stays out of canon and future turns until you accept it.Submit for reviewNeeds your reviewLocation → North PierEditAcceptRejectMemoriesKeep important details for this adventure.1 to reviewShowing 1 of 1 memories. Older versions are available from each memory’s history.Player noteMemory useShared story memoryOnly selected characters knowAuthor guidance for the narratorPrivate · never send to a modelImportanceMinor detailUseful detailMajor eventAllow this note in story context when its scope permitsSave noteEvent · proposed · usefulv1 · story order 1 · Known by رُها / Roya · sourced to a story turnمه کنار می‌رود. Roya sees a second light answering from the ridge.RejectAccept into memoryCurrent situationRebuild draftAfter the story, location, or threads change, update and review this summary before it can be used again.Editable summaryRebuilt summaries wait for review before entering model context.Save situation for reviewOpen threadsThreadDetailAdd open threadNPCsCharacter profiles and optional, reviewed off-screen activity.Simulate up to two approved NPCs every five completed turns. Suggestions always wait for review.Match, link an alias, or create an NPCExisting NPCCreate a new NPCNew NPC nameAliasesAppearanceMotivationCurrent goalWhereaboutsVoiceRelationship to protagonistDescribe the NPC's current stance as narrator guidance. The protagonist does not automatically know this; off-screen updates wait for your review.Private author notesPrivate notes are visible only in this panel and are never included in story context.Save approved NPC profileMap & travelCurrent place: Old HarborTravel changes the current location only when you choose an approved map point. Model-suggested locations remain proposals.Old HarborplaceHereNorth PierplaceTravelSuggested location: North Pier · review it in Character & game state.IllustrationsAdd or review