rnal exchanges have been imported on this branch.The importer verifies branch identity, contiguous turns within each segment, matching content across overlaps, transcript hash, and context revision. A stale or incomplete transcript is retained for review without changing official state."}},{"k":"activeLabel","v":{"v":"null"}},{"k":"activeRole","v":{"v":"null"}}],"id":2}},{"k":"isFunction","v":{"b":true}}],"id":1}}}
